# Relations this migration declares; probed by db-schema/tests/schema_fence.rs.
#
# Three nullable ADD COLUMNs against `fill_events`, which 0001 created, plus a
# `COMMENT ON COLUMN` for each. None is a relation, so the existence probe is
# blind to it — the same position 0019_fair_price_fx_tape_live is in.
#
# The columns are asserted by their writer and reader instead: the fill
# round-trip in indexer/tests/store_postgres.rs writes all three through
# `fill_insert.sql` and reads them back through `SELECT *`.
none adds three nullable columns and their comments to a table 0001 created, not a relation
